  </a>

  </div>

</div>
<footer class="footer">
  <div class="footer-brand">
    <a href="/" class="footer-logo">Should<span>I</span>Spend</a>
    <p>
      Practical financial decision tools for purchases, payments, trips,
      weddings, subscriptions, and everyday spending choices.
